---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Hermetic Philosophy: The Macrocosmic Mirror | Hub II"
  description="Where Gnosticism diagnoses the error of the Below, Hermeticism provides the operational physics of the Above. Decode the Alexandrian alchemical traditions."
>
  <main class="site-wrapper section theme-affirming" style="padding-top: 40px;">
      
    <!-- WAYFINDING CONDUIT -->
    <nav class="shsq-wayfinding-conduit reveal" aria-label="Hub Navigation" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 50px auto; padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        <li><a href="/the-escape-matrix/">&#8629; Master Grid</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--shsq-muted);">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page" style="color: var(--shsq-parchment);">Hub II: Hermetic Philosophy</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="adjacent-node">
        <a href="/kabbalistic-mechanics/" style="font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; padding-bottom: 2px;">Engage Hub III &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HUB HERO -->
    <header class="shsq-hub-hero reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
      <span class="archive-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">Hub II &middot; The Macrocosmic Mirror</span>
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin: 0 0 25px 0; line-height: 1.1;">Hermetic Philosophy</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        Where Gnosticism diagnoses the error of the Below, Hermeticism provides the operational physics of the Above. This hub decodes the Alexandrian alchemical traditions, the <em>Corpus Hermeticum</em>, and the Emerald Tablet. It is the science of sympathetic resonance—understanding how the human micro-vessel can be deliberately calibrated to reflect, manipulate, and ultimately command the macro-matrix.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- PILLAR CLUSTER GRID (6 NODES) -->
    <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-1" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 80px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
        
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 1: The Master Axiom</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Emerald Lineage</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          Deconstruct the <em>Tabula Smaragdina</em>. Analyze the foundational axiom of "As Above, So Below" not as poetic metaphor, but as a rigid quantum mechanic governing energetic reflection.
        </p>
        <a href="/hermetic-philosophy/the-emerald-lineage/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 2: The Universal Network</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Nous (Divine Mind)</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          Map the Hermetic concept that "The All is Mind." Understand how consciousness acts as the primary substrate of the simulation, rendering all physical matter as secondary projection.
        </p>
        <a href="/hermetic-philosophy/the-nous/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 3: Astrological Density</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Seven Governors</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          Navigate the planetary spheres. Unlike the Gnostic Archons (viewed purely as jailers), Hermeticism maps these spheres as energetic densities the initiate must consciously master and transmute.
        </p>
        <a href="/hermetic-philosophy/the-seven-governors/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 4: Energetic Mirroring</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">Sympathetic Resonance</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          The physics of occult magnetism. Learn how the operator manipulates material reality by deliberately altering the corresponding frequency within the unseen causal architecture.
        </p>
        <a href="/hermetic-philosophy/sympathetic-resonance/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 5 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 5: The Inner Crucible</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">Spiritual Alchemy</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          Decode the stages of the Great Work. Translate Calcination, Dissolution, and Coagulation into a strict neuro-psychological protocol designed to burn away the false personality.
        </p>
        <a href="/hermetic-philosophy/spiritual-alchemy/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 6 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 6: The Ultimate Exit</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Palingenesis</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          The mechanics of rebirth. Map the operational procedure for exiting the cycle of generation and reintegrating localized awareness back into the Ogdoad (The Eighth Sphere).
        </p>
        <a href="/hermetic-philosophy/the-palingenesis/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- TERMINAL PROMPT -->
    <aside class="shsq-terminal-prompt reveal" aria-labelledby="terminal-heading" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 80px auto; text-align: center;">
      <h2 id="terminal-heading">The Blueprint is Active</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        The physics of the Macrocosm have been revealed. But physics without mathematical architecture remains theoretical. To understand how consciousness systematically descends into geometric form, you must engage the Third Pillar of the Affirming Force.
      </p>
      <a href="/kabbalistic-mechanics/" class="btn btn-primary">
        Engage Hub III &#8599;
      </a>
    </aside>

    <footer class="shsq-footer-note reveal reveal-delay-2" style="text-align: center; color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.2); padding-top: 30px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">History SQ: Decoding the Enneagrammatic Escape Plan &middot; Guided by Sophia Mysterion.</p>
    </footer>

  </main>
</Layout>